    <comment>drmcru is a modern TUI utility written in Rust for managing Linux DRM/KMS custom resolutions. It allows users to inspect/edit monitor EDID data, export patched EDID binaries, and apply kernel-level overrides. It also features native Hyprland integration for live mode discovery, mode switching, and generating Hyprland monitor rules (hyprland.conf / Lua hl.monitor).</comment>
